id: shishkebab
name: Shishkebab
kind: crafting
slots: 1~3
prerequisites: This Weapon was created through a Gear Kit or Crafting.
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Wielded: a Snack for an Action, once a Combat Encounter for each Slot.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Triggered]: While this Weapon is equipped, you may spend 1 Action to gain a Snack Basic Item.
  You can use this effect a number of times per Combat Encounter equal to the number of Quality
  Slots this Weapon Quality is occupying.
text: >
  Shishkebab: This Weapon also serves as a convenient way to carry a hearty snack.
  –Weapon Type: All
  –Prerequisites: This Weapon was created through a Gear Kit or Crafting.
  –Quality Slots: 1~3
  –Effects: While this Weapon is equipped, you may spend 1 Action to gain a Snack Basic Item.
  You can use this effect a number of times per Combat Encounter equal to the number of Quality
  Slots this Weapon Quality is occupying.

---

# From the Weapon's row while it is in hand. How the Weapon came to be - Gear Kit, Crafting - is
# not kept here, so its Prerequisite is the table's.
[passive]
weapon.snacks += $slots;
